      "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 02 2026 14:03:34 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Medical Education program offerings</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We have an established and experienced team of medical education professionals who lead regular national, regional and local training and education programs. These programs are intended for interventional and non-interventional physicians, nursing staff and other personnel involved in Stryker's Peripheral Vascular procedures.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">With our team of experts, we greatly expanded our learning opportunities to provide regular and interactive training to a full spectrum of medical professionals.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 10 2026 14:49:44 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
