          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">PV-Learn Summits bring together residents, fellows and early-career physicians for immersive, hands-on learning experiences.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Multidisciplinary expert faculty and panels</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Case-based discussions and collaborative learning</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Hands-on training using advanced simulation technology</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Practical skills and insights to support early career development</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
